  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/smol-machines/smolvm/zipball/v1.16.1",
  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Speed up pack compression with bounded zstd workers by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1243\n* Fix checkpoint restore port collisions and startup diagnostics by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1248\n* Reuse cached image layers for offline exports by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1244\n* Allow retrying machines after failed image pulls by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1250\n* Fix exports from stopped branches by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1251\n* Size the pack extraction cache from the disk instead of a fixed 5 GiB by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1249\n* Bundle sparse branchable memory promotion by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1252\n* cuda: expose VMM allocation APIs to PyTorch by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1256\n* Stream checkpoint artifacts without redundant file passes by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1253\n* Avoid redundant checkpoint RAM copies on Linux by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1257\n* Keep packed image extraction out of metadata queries by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1261\n* Quiesce guest storage before graceful shutdown by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1260\n* Map shared image layers into export helpers by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1258\n* Restore prepared checkpoints safely from the node cache by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1259\n* Expose workload image in machine responses by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1262\n* Clean up cancelled checkpoint captures by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1263\n* Update rustls to address RustSec advisory by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1268\n* Keep machines responsive and recoverable while checkpoints save by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1269\n* Fix failures when restoring the same checkpoint concurrently by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1272\n* Keep checkpoint restores isolated under private service permissions by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1276\n* Avoid connection delays after restoring a machine by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1273\n* Accept published-port connections without polling delays by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1274\n* Complete partial writes when copying checkpoint disks by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1277\n* Share immutable checkpoint disks between restored machines by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1278\n* Prepare SmolVM v1.16.1 for release by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1280\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.16.0...v1.16.1",
